<section id="now">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-k"><span class="sn">15</span>Afterlife</div><h2 class="rv">Why this one is a ghost</h2><p class="lede rv">The company is gone. The name has had four owners since 2015 and still sells electronics.</p></div>
<div class="now-grid">
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">Apr 2015</div><h3>The stores</h3><p>General Wireless, a Standard General affiliate, bought 1,743 stores, many co-branded with Sprint. The rest were liquidated.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-16">16</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-21">21</a></sup></p></div>
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">2015</div><h3>Mexico</h3><p>The Mexican subsidiaries went to Office Depot de México for $31.9M.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-16">16</a></sup></p></div>
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">Mar 2017</div><h3>Second bankruptcy</h3><p>General Wireless filed for Chapter 11 and began closing hundreds of stores. Sprint later paid $12M in a settlement.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-26">26</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-27">27</a></sup></p></div>
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">Nov 2020</div><h3>The brand, online</h3><p>Retail Ecommerce Ventures bought the brands, websites and the “You’ve got questions” trademark.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-28">28</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-29">29</a></sup></p></div>
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">2022</div><h3>The crypto detour</h3><p>REV turned radioshack.com into a waitlist for a cryptocurrency project, warning visitors about impostor accounts.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-32">32</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-33">33</a></sup></p></div>
<div class="now rv"><div class="st">May 2023 – today</div><h3>The new owner</h3><p>Unicomer Group of El Salvador, a RadioShack franchisee in Latin America and the Caribbean, bought the IP in about 70 countries. RadioShack-branded stores today are dealer or franchise locations, and the brand sells online.<sup class="fn"><a href="#src-30">30</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-31">31</a></sup><sup class="fn"><a href="#src-33">33</a></sup></p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

